#: ../../source/reference/cli/index.md:3
msgid ""
"`freeports` extracts. The two other distributions do the jobs around it: "
"`freeports-dev` is what a format author works in all day, and `freeports-"
"validate` is how a claim about a file gets a name and a signature "
"attached. Neither is needed to run an extraction; both are needed to "
"maintain a formats repository."
msgstr ""

